{"id":"schlucken","lemma":"schlucken","pos":"verb","rank":3949,"glosses":["to swallow","to gulp (swallow one's spittle out of fear etc.)","to gobble up (annex, e.g. another company)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃlʊkən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/82/De-schlucken.ogg/De-schlucken.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"schlucke","1p":"schlucken","2s":"schluckst","2p":"schluckt","3s":"schluckt","3p":"schlucken"},"preterite":{"1s":"schluckte","1p":"schluckten","2s":"schlucktest","2p":"schlucktet","3s":"schluckte","3p":"schluckten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe geschluckt","1p":"haben geschluckt","2s":"hast geschluckt","2p":"habt geschluckt","3s":"hat geschluckt","3p":"haben geschluckt"},"future":{"1s":"werde schlucken","1p":"werden schlucken","2s":"wirst schlucken","2p":"werdet schlucken","3s":"wird schlucken","3p":"werden schlucken"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"schluck","2p":"schluckt"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde schlucken","1p":"würden schlucken","2s":"würdest schlucken","2p":"würdet schlucken","3s":"würde schlucken","3p":"würden schlucken"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"geschluckt"},"examples":[{"text":"Fällt dir das Schlucken noch schwer?","en":"Are you still having any difficulty swallowing?","words":[{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"heavy, weighty"}]},{"text":"Diese Klimaanlage schluckt viel Strom.","en":"This air conditioner uses a lot of electricity.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"air conditioner"},null,{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"a large river"}]},{"text":"Mir tut beim Schlucken der Hals weh.","en":"My throat hurts when I swallow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/565999","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"at the"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"neck"},{"g":"sore, painful"}]},{"text":"Er schluckte seinen Stolz hinunter.","en":"He swallowed his pride.","words":[{"g":"he / i